From afe92018da41ba235670547b9647dc2074ec9e0f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MediaGuard <mediaguard@localhost>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] MediaGuard: hook client and environment configuration

Adds NzbDrone.Core.MediaGuard with:
- MediaGuardHookOptions read from MEDIAGUARD_* environment variables
  (URL, INSTANCE_ID, HOOK_KEY, HOOK_TIMEOUT_MS, HOOK_FAIL_POLICY,
  SHADOW_MODE, HOOK_CIRCUIT_BREAK_SECONDS)
- MediaGuardHookClient: POST {MEDIAGUARD_URL}/api/v1/hooks/{hook} with
  X-MediaGuard-Hook-Key, bounded timeout, fail open/closed policy and a
  short circuit breaker so an outage never stalls RSS sync or imports
- snake_case request payloads per packages/contracts/fork-hooks.md
